<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>The Cutting Room — Ad Editor Training</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0D0D14; --bg-2:#090910;
    --panel:#16161F; --panel-2:#1E1E2B; --panel-3:#282837;
    --line:#2E2E3E; --line-2:#3B3B4F;
    --text:#EDEDF4; --text-2:#B4B4C6; --muted:#7F7F98;
    --good:#34D399; --good-soft:rgba(52,211,153,.14);
    --bad:#FB6E7E;  --bad-soft:rgba(251,110,126,.14);
    --accent:#A78BFA; --accent-soft:rgba(167,139,250,.15);
    --radius:13px;
    --shadow:0 20px 48px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.75);
    --mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
    --disp:'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif;
    --body:'Figtree',system-ui,sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 500px at 12% -8%, rgba(167,139,250,.10), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(900px 500px at 92% 4%, rgba(56,189,248,.08), transparent 60%),
      var(--bg);
    color:var(--text); font-family:var(--body); font-size:16px; line-height:1.62;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; min-height:100vh;
  }
  a{color:var(--accent)}
  button{font-family:inherit}
  ::selection{background:var(--accent-soft);color:#fff}

  .wrap{max-width:940px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px}
  @media(max-width:600px){.wrap{padding:14px}}

  .topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .rec{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 var(--accent);animation:pulse 2.4s infinite;flex:none}
  @keyframes pulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(167,139,250,.5)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 9px rgba(167,139,250,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(167,139,250,0)}}
  .brand .kick{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.24em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}
  .brand h1{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:clamp(20px,2.6vw,28px);margin:1px 0 0;line-height:1}
  .top-tools{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .admin-badge{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#0c1b17;background:var(--good);padding:6px 11px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
  .tool{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line-2);padding:8px 11px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
  .tool:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--text)}

  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .pad{padding:30px 34px}
  @media(max-width:600px){.pad{padding:22px 18px}}

  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}
  .eyebrow .sq{width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:2px}
  .title{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.03;font-size:clamp(26px,4.2vw,42px);margin:12px 0 6px}
  .subtitle{color:var(--text-2);font-size:clamp(15px,1.7vw,18px);max-width:64ch}

  .start-lead{color:var(--text-2);font-size:16px;margin:14px 0 22px;max-width:60ch}
  .field label{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:7px}
  .field input{width:100%;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--body);font-size:15px;padding:13px 14px}
  .field input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft)}
  .field{margin-bottom:18px}
  .warn{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(251,191,36,.12),rgba(251,191,36,.06));border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.35);border-radius:12px;padding:15px 17px;margin:4px 0 22px}
  .warn h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;font-family:var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c451}
  .warn ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .warn li{position:relative;padding-left:20px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#f0ddb2;font-size:14px}
  .warn li:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
  .warn li::before{content:"!";position:absolute;left:4px;top:0;color:#f5c451;font-weight:700;font-family:var(--mono)}
  .err{color:var(--bad);font-size:13px;margin:-8px 0 14px;min-height:18px}
  .admin-row{margin-top:18px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line-2)}
  .admin-toggle{background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;cursor:pointer;padding:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .admin-toggle:hover{color:var(--text-2)}
  .admin-panel{margin-top:14px;display:none}
  .admin-panel.show{display:block}
  .admin-fields{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .admin-fields input{flex:1;min-width:160px}

  .tl-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.06em;margin:0 2px 8px}
  .tl-meta b{color:var(--accent);font-weight:500}
  .timeline{display:flex;gap:5px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:20px;scrollbar-width:thin}
  .timeline::-webkit-scrollbar{height:6px}
  .timeline::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line-2);border-radius:3px}
  .seg{position:relative;flex:1 1 0;min-width:64px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:9px 9px 10px;text-align:left;color:var(--muted);overflow:hidden;cursor:default}
  .seg.clickable{cursor:pointer}
  .seg.clickable:hover{border-color:var(--line-2)}
  .seg .fill{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.16;width:0;transition:width .5s}
  .seg.done .fill{width:100%}
  .seg .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;position:relative}
  .seg .ic{position:absolute;top:8px;right:9px;font-size:11px}
  .seg.active{color:var(--text)}
  .seg.done{color:var(--text-2)}
  .seg.active::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:-1px;transform:translateX(-50%);width:60%;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--seg-accent)}

  .rule{height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--line) 42%,transparent);margin:22px 0 2px;opacity:.7}
  .prose{margin-top:20px;max-width:70ch}
  .prose p{margin:0 0 15px}
  .prose h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:26px 0 10px;color:#fff}
  .prose strong{color:#fff;font-weight:700}
  .prose ul{margin:0 0 16px;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .prose li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--text-2)}
  .prose li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:11px;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:1.5px;transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .prose li strong{color:var(--text)}
  .callout{background:var(--accent-soft);border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:11px;padding:13px 16px;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--text)}
  .callout::before{content:"NOTE";font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--accent);display:block;margin-bottom:5px}
  .diagram{margin:6px 0 20px;padding:16px 16px 10px;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}
  .diagram svg{display:block;font-family:var(--body)}
  .diagram figcaption{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:10px;letter-spacing:.02em}

  .quiz{margin-top:6px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line-2)}
  .quiz-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px}
  .quiz-h .lab{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:21px}
  .quiz-h .cnt{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:auto}
  .warn-mini{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:#f5c451;margin:2px 0 18px}
  .scorebar{height:6px;background:var(--panel-3);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:22px}
  .scorebar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--accent);transition:width .4s}
  .q{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel-2);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 18px 8px;margin-bottom:15px}
  .q .qhead{display:flex;gap:11px;margin-bottom:13px}
  .q .qn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);padding-top:2px;min-width:26px}
  .q .qt{font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}
  .opt{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:9px;color:var(--text-2);transition:.13s;font-size:15px}
  .opt:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--line-2);color:var(--text)}
  .opt:disabled{cursor:default}
  .opt .key{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:6px;min-width:24px;height:24px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
  .opt.correct{border-color:var(--good);background:var(--good-soft);color:#d6f5e6}
  .opt.correct .key{border-color:var(--good);color:var(--good)}
  .opt.wrong{border-color:var(--bad);background:var(--bad-soft);color:#f7dde1}
  .opt.wrong .key{border-color:var(--bad);color:var(--bad)}
  .opt.dim{opacity:.5}
  .opt .locktag{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;align-self:center;white-space:nowrap}
  .explain{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-2);border-left:2px solid var(--accent);padding-left:13px;margin:2px 2px 14px;display:none}
  .explain.show{display:block}
  .explain b{color:var(--accent);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;display:block;margin-bottom:3px}

  .btn{font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:11px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);background:var(--panel-2);color:var(--text);transition:.15s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%}
  .btn:hover{border-color:var(--line-2);background:var(--panel-3)}
  .btn.pri{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#140a25;font-weight:700}
  .btn.pri:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
  .btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
  .btn-row{margin-top:22px}
  .subnote{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:9px}

  .sc-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px}
  .sc-rows{margin:18px 0}
  .sc-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .sc-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .sc-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;flex:none}
  .sc-name{font-size:14.5px;flex:1;min-width:0}
  .sc-name b{font-weight:600}
  .sc-name span{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-left:6px}
  .sc-score{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;font-weight:500}
  .sc-mini{height:5px;width:70px;background:var(--panel-3);border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;flex:none}
  .sc-mini i{display:block;height:100%}
  .sc-total{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--panel-2),var(--panel));border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}
  .sc-total .big{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,54px);line-height:1}
  .sc-total .big.pass{color:var(--good)} .sc-total .big.fail{color:#f5c451}
  .sc-total .msg{flex:1;min-width:170px}
  .sc-total .msg h4{margin:0 0 3px;font-family:var(--disp);font-size:20px}
  .sc-total .msg p{margin:0;color:var(--text-2);font-size:14px}
  .sc-foot{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:16px}

  .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(5,5,9,.74);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);z-index:60;display:none;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:30px 14px;overflow:auto}
  .overlay.show{display:flex}
  .modal{width:100%;max-width:740px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .modal-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:17px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .modal-h h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;margin:0;font-size:19px}
  .modal-h .x{margin-left:auto;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:8px;width:34px;height:34px;color:var(--text-2);cursor:pointer;font-size:18px}
  .modal-b{padding:18px 20px}
  .modal-f{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:15px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .modal-f .btn{width:auto;flex:none}
  .spacer{flex:1}
  .mrow{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .mrow .mc{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);min-width:28px}
  .mrow .mt{flex:1;font-weight:600;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .mrow .mbtn{background:var(--panel-3);border:1px solid var(--line-2);color:var(--text-2);border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;padding:6px 9px}
  .mrow .mbtn:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:var(--accent)}
  .mrow .mbtn.danger:hover{color:var(--bad);border-color:var(--bad)}
  .medit .field{margin-bottom:13px}
  .medit textarea,.medit input{width:100%;background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:9px;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--body);font-size:14px;padding:10px 12px;resize:vertical}
  .medit textarea{min-height:150px;line-height:1.5}
  .medit .hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
  .qedit{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:10px;background:var(--panel-2)}
  .qtop{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .qtop input{flex:1}
  .optline{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px}
  .optline input[type=text]{flex:1}
  .optline input[type=radio]{accent-color:var(--accent);width:17px;height:17px}
  .optline .rm{background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font-size:16px}

  .toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(18px);background:var(--panel-3);border:1px solid var(--accent);color:var(--text);padding:11px 18px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;z-index:80;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.25s}
  .toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
  .footer{max-width:940px;margin:12px auto 40px;padding:0 22px;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.05em}

  body.locked, body.locked *{-webkit-user-select:none;-moz-user-select:none;user-select:none}
  body.locked input, body.locked textarea{-webkit-user-select:text;-moz-user-select:text;user-select:text}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap" id="app"></div>
  <div class="footer" id="footer"></div>
  <div class="overlay" id="overlay"><div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal-h"><h3 id="modalTitle">Manage modules</h3><button class="x" id="modalClose" aria-label="Close">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal-b" id="modalBody"></div><div class="modal-f" id="modalFooter"></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="overlay" id="confirmOverlay"><div class="modal" style="max-width:430px" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="confirmTitle">
    <div class="modal-h"><h3 id="confirmTitle">Leave the test?</h3></div>
    <div class="modal-b">All your progress will be lost and you'll return to the start page.</div>
    <div class="modal-f"><span class="spacer"></span><button class="btn" id="confirmNo" style="width:auto;flex:none">Stay</button><button class="btn pri" id="confirmYes" style="width:auto;flex:none">Leave</button></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script>
/* ============================================================================
   THE CUTTING ROOM — editable module data
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   • Edit modules directly below, OR use "Manage modules" in admin mode, then
     "Export" to save your changes as JSON.
   • ADMIN_CODE (just below) is the passcode that unlocks all modules on the
     start screen. Change it to whatever you like.
   • Email delivery is OFF (collect-only). To turn it on later, wire one service
     inside deliverResults() near the bottom — the spot is marked.
   • Lesson markup: "## heading", "- bullet", "> note", blank line = paragraph,
     "**bold**".  Each question: { q, options:[...], answer:<index>, explain }.
   ========================================================================== */
const ADMIN_CODE = "cutadmin";      // <-- change this passcode
const LOCK_CONTENT = true;          // deters copying (blocks select / copy / right-click / drag). NOT real security. Set false to allow copying.
const PASS = 0.7;                   // pass mark for the scorecard badge

const DEFAULT_MODULES = [
  { num:"1", color:"#A78BFA", title:"Purpose of the SOP",
    subtitle:"Why this playbook exists and the standard every ad is held to.",
    lesson:
`This SOP gives every editor a **clear, structured, repeatable process** for making video and static ads — so every ad keeps the same creativity, clarity, and conversion focus, no matter who edits it.

> The editing tool used throughout this SOP is **Adobe Premiere Pro** — all the workflow steps and examples assume you're working in Premiere Pro.

## The goal
Help every editor work **smarter, faster, and more effectively** while holding a consistent brand identity and high production standard.

> The real test: no matter who edits an ad, it should look like it came from the same skilled team.

Strategists write a script built to convert. Your job as an editor is to bring it to life visually — so viewers stop scrolling, watch to the end, and click.

## Why it exists
As the team grows, everyone needs the same creative direction and workflow. This SOP is here to:
- **Ensure consistency** — every ad aligns with the brand's visual and emotional tone.
- **Save time** — proven workflows mean you don't reinvent the process each brief.
- **Maintain quality** — each video meets our standards for pacing, audio, text, and visuals.
- **Simplify onboarding** — new editors get up to speed fast, without hours of hand-holding.
- **Encourage innovation** — a solid foundation lets you build creative variations confidently.

> Consistency and creativity aren't opposites. The SOP is the floor you build on, not a cage.`,
    questions:[
      {q:"What is the core purpose of this SOP?",options:["A repeatable process for consistent, conversion-focused ads","Automation to replace human editors","A legal contract between editors and clients","A pricing guide for ads"],answer:0,explain:"The SOP is a clear, repeatable process so quality stays consistent no matter who edits."},
      {q:"Whose job is it to bring the converting script to life visually?",options:["The creative strategist","The client","The editor","The media buyer"],answer:2,explain:"Strategists write the converting script; the editor makes it visual enough to stop the scroll and drive the click."},
      {q:"Which of these is NOT one of the five reasons the SOP exists?",options:["Save time","Maintain quality","Guarantee every ad goes viral","Simplify onboarding"],answer:2,explain:"The five reasons are consistency, saving time, quality, onboarding, and innovation."},
      {q:"How does the SOP treat creativity?",options:["It bans creative variation to keep ads identical","It encourages innovation on a consistent foundation","It leaves creativity undefined","It allows creativity only for senior editors"],answer:1,explain:"The SOP is a foundation that lets editors build creative variations confidently."},
      {q:"'Save time' in this SOP mainly means…",options:["Following proven workflows instead of reinventing the process","Skipping the review checklist","Using fewer b-rolls","Exporting at lower resolution"],answer:0,explain:"Proven workflows let editors move efficiently without starting from scratch each brief."},
      {q:"For a new editor, the SOP is designed to…",options:["Replace their training entirely","Help them ramp up quickly without long onboarding","Slow them down with red tape","Restrict them to static ads only"],answer:1,explain:"Simplified onboarding means new editors understand expectations fast."}
    ]},

  { num:"2", color:"#FB7185", title:"What Makes a Great Ad",
    subtitle:"The mindset, the hook, the cuts, and the elements every winning ad shares.",
    lesson:
`Before editing, decide **who the ad is for** — gender and age — then edit for how that person watches.

## Purpose-driven pacing
- **Younger viewers (teens–40s)** are doomscrolling. Grab them with fast cuts, animation, b-rolls, and energetic pacing.
- **Older viewers (45+)** aren't rushing. Once the hook lands they'll patiently watch, even a simple talking clip.

The **inspiration video in the brief** shows the target pacing and tone to replicate. It also shows the style and captions to use, unless specified otherwise.

## The elements of a winning ad
A scroll-stopping **hook** (visual + audio), then **pacing and flow** to the end. Because our brands are health and supplement products, the **avatar and voice must be ultra-realistic** — fake anything kills trust. **B-rolls** match the script and show the mechanism, **transitions and zooms** add energy, everything stays inside the **safe zone**, and **music** sets the mood without overpowering the voice.

## The hook — the most important part
It filters the audience in the first three seconds and combines **visual, audio, and text overlay**. Three hook types:
- **Curiosity-driven** — intrigue or a surprising result.
- **Disgust / shock-driven** — an instant gut reaction; must look realistic, not cartoonish.
- **Problem-addressing** — calls out the viewer's exact problem.

Text overlays matter because many people scroll on mute, and humans instinctively read on-screen text.

## Audio pacing
- Cut out pauses, breaths, and unnecessary parts.
- Use the **waveform** to cut precisely — don't chop off letters or words. Use the **razor tool** to cut the beginning and end of the unnecessary parts, then delete each of them.
- Use **Sequence > Close Gap** to instantly remove all silences instead of dragging clips by hand.

## Three cuts every editor uses
- **J-cut** — the audio of the next clip starts **before** its visual appears.
- **L-cut** — the audio of the current clip **continues** after the next visual begins.
- **Jump cut** — your most-used cut. Keep it seamless with **"Cut the Head and Keep the Tail."**

**"Cut the Head and Keep the Tail"** means: remove the **start** of the next line up to where its audio begins, and **keep a little of the previous line** even after it finishes. This makes the jump feel natural instead of rushed or choppy.

> Safe zone & export: keep captions, text overlays, product b-rolls and packaging inside the safe zone. Video is **9:16, 1080×1920 only**.`,
    questions:[
      {q:"For a younger, doomscrolling audience, your pacing should be…",options:["Slow, with long talking clips","Fast and energetic — quick cuts, animation, b-rolls","Silent with no music","Static images only"],answer:1,explain:"Younger viewers need fast, energetic pacing so they have to focus to keep up."},
      {q:"Why must AI avatars and voices look and sound ultra-realistic?",options:["To win design awards","Because our brands live on trust and authenticity","To reduce render time","Because platforms require it"],answer:1,explain:"Any hint of fakeness destroys trust and the viewer skips."},
