      {q:"How does nesting the Body help?",options:["Every version shares one editable Body — fix it once and all versions update","It shrinks the export file","It adds background music automatically","It speeds up rendering"],answer:0,explain:"Nesting links every Hook × CTA combination to one editable Body, so one fix updates them all."}
