      {q:"To make a voice sound distant and muffled, you should…",options:["Reduce high frequencies with a low-pass filter and add slight reverb","Boost the high frequencies","Increase the volume to maximum","Remove all ambience"],answer:0,explain:"A low-pass filter cuts treble for a muffled tone; a touch of reverb adds distance."},
