      {q:"Which is a requirement of a good reference frame?",options:["Eyes closed for a candid look","Motion blur to imply energy","Eyes open, lips visible, well-lit and sharp, no blur, hands visible","On-screen subtitles kept for context"],answer:2,explain:"Clear, well-lit, blur-free frames with visible eyes, lips and hands produce the most realistic avatar."},
